<p>Here's your push key so you can push gems to any of your namespaces.</p>

<p>It expires in 24 hours and has replaced an existing active key, if any.<p>

<%= tag.code @push_key.token %>

<p>You can pass it to push/release commands, like this:</p>

<pre>
  <%= tag.code Peak::Command.gem_push @push_key.token, namespace_url(@namespace) %>
  <%= tag.code Peak::Command.rake_release @push_key.token, namespace_url(@namespace) %>
</pre>

<p>You can <%= link_to "request a new push key here", new_user_push_key_url(@push_key.user.slice(:email_address)) %>. We've prefilled your email address.<p>
